# Top-level packages of the desktop app's Python runtime. The locks the
# installers use are generated from this file and requirements-torch.in
# with uv; each starts with the command that made it.
#   requirements-win.txt             Windows, everything but PyTorch
#   requirements-win-torch-cuda.txt  Windows PyTorch, CUDA 12.6
#   requirements-win-torch-cpu.txt   Windows PyTorch, CPU
#   requirements-mac.txt             macOS on Apple Silicon, generated with
#                                    MACOSX_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET=14.0
-r requirements-torch.in
